# The public Mezo testnet RPC the live preview widget reads through (chainId 31611, read-only:
# no wallet, no writes, no mainnet). The widget already DEFAULTS to the public endpoint below, so
# it reads live without any config. Set this only to OVERRIDE the endpoint, for example a dedicated
# or higher-rate-limit testnet RPC, for local dev or the deployed site.
#
# Local dev: copy this file to `.env` (in landing/) and adjust if needed.
# Deploy (musdkit.xyz): set PUBLIC_MEZO_TESTNET_RPC_URL in the host's environment to use a dedicated
# endpoint; if unset, the public default below is used and the widget still reads live.
PUBLIC_MEZO_TESTNET_RPC_URL=https://rpc.test.mezo.org
